cs><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">a\\to0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>图像特征</strong>：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">v</span></span></span></span>-<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span> 图的斜率 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span></span></span></span>——斜率从最大开始<strong>逐渐减小到 0</strong>，图像是<strong>凹口向下</strong>的曲线，末段趋近水平线。</p>\n<p>选 <strong>A</strong>。</p>\n","evilHtml":"<p><strong>适用特征</strong>：恒力+电阻 → <strong>一句话图像口诀</strong>：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>&quot;a 递减，曲线趋水平&quot;</strong>（斜率从大变小、末段匀速——对应<a href=\"#/node/physics/electromagnetism/induction/rod-models\">五模型</a>里的模型 3）。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<ul>\n<li>恒流源（模型1）：a 不变 → 直线（选项 B）；</li>\n<li>初速滑行（模型2）：v 减小、a 减小 → 反向曲线（先快后慢）；</li>\n<li>恒力+电阻（模型3）：本题，A。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>20 秒选 A</strong>——先认模型，再判斜率。</p>\n","meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":[],"summary":"光滑水平导轨上，导体棒受恒定水平拉力 F F F 作用（回路有电阻 R R R ，磁场垂直导轨平面），由静止开始运动。棒的速度 v v v 随时间 t t t 变化的图像大致为（ ） A. 斜率逐渐减小的曲线，最终趋近水平（匀速） B. 斜","source":"自编（经典考法）","difficulty":"较难","applicability":"选填通用","risk":"图像判读看\"斜率=加速度\"：恒力+电阻回路的加速度随速度增大而减小（凹口向下的曲线）；终点是水平渐近线（匀速）不是停下。","fit":["恒力拉棒（带电阻回路）的 v-t 图像","判断斜率变化与末状态","选填题"],"updated":"Mon Feb 24 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"physics","title":"物理"},{"slug":"electromagnetism","title":"电磁学"},{"slug":"induction","title":"电磁感应"},{"slug":"induction-comprehensive","title":"恒力拉棒 v-t 图像（a 递减趋匀速）"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"ampere-work-heat","title":"电磁感应中的焦耳热（安培力做功）","type":"example"},{"slug":"double-rod","title":"双棒共速（安培力是内力）","type":"example"},{"slug":"force-cap-calc","title":"恒力+电容模型计算（等效质量）","type":"example"},{"slug":"induction-image","title":"电磁感应图像（斜率定电动势）","type":"example"},{"slug":"induction","title":"电磁感应","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"phi-t-image","title":"Φ-t 图像（斜率即电动势）","type":"example"},{"slug":"rod-models","title":"导轨与电磁感应五模型","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"rod-rail-fall","title":"竖直导轨匀速（mgR/B²L²）","type":"example"},{"slug":"single-rod-template","title":"电磁感应·单棒恒外力（模板）","type":"example"},{"slug":"sliding-rod","title":"滑行棒总位移（动量+电量）","type":"example"}]}